#: public/build/extendify-agentx-5123061faaccc9af69d5.js:1208
#: src/AgentX/chat/PlanPanel.jsx:92
msgid "Completed"
msgstr "Finalizat"

#. translators: Title of the list of steps the AI Agent plans to take for the user's request, when the plan has no title of its own. A noun, as in "the plan".
#: public/build/extendify-agentx-5123061faaccc9af69d5.js:1213
#: src/AgentX/chat/PlanPanel.jsx:101
msgid "Plan"
msgstr "Plan"

#. translators: Screen reader name of the Stop button on the AI Agent's plan, the list of steps above the chat box. It ends the plan before its steps are done.
#: public/build/extendify-agentx-5123061faaccc9af69d5.js:1216
#: src/AgentX/chat/PlanPanel.jsx:195
