#: public/build/extendify-agentx-5123061faaccc9af69d5.js:1228
#: src/AgentX/chat/ResolveChanges.jsx:26
msgid "More than one block now looks like the one this edit changed."
msgstr "Acum mai multe blocuri arată ca acela pe care l-a modificat această editare."

#. translators: Reason shown under the name of one of the user's unsaved edits that the AI Agent couldn't apply again: It means that named edit, and builds on means it was made on top of an earlier edit that also failed.
#: public/build/extendify-agentx-5123061faaccc9af69d5.js:1231
#: src/AgentX/chat/ResolveChanges.jsx:32
